 "notes": "RE-CHECK (2026-11-03): ADDED 'كلية التعليم التقني' with 10 intermediate diploma (دبلوم) programmes. The college's existence is confirmed by an official 2025 AABU announcement (see previous notes), but the diploma list comes from a SECONDARY source (tumoohi.org university page) because AABU's brochure PDF and web2.aabu.edu.jo/regDepartment/bs.jsp could not be read; English names are translations. Treat the diploma names as unverified until checked against AABU. The official colleges index (aabu.edu.jo/AR/collegesandinstitutes) lists 10 colleges + 4 institutes; Foreign Languages and Applied Medical Sciences are not on that index but have their own official pages (kept). Leads NOT added (secondary only, unverified): IT 'جرافيك الحاسوب والرسوم المتحركة وتصميم وتطوير ألعاب الحاسوب', Engineering 'المعلوماتية الطبية', Business 'التسويق الالكتروني والتواصل الاجتماعي', 'الرقابة والتدقيق المالي' (tumoohi); 'الإمامة والوعظ والإرشاد', 'التسويق الرقمي', 'نظم المعلومات المحاسبية', 'نظم المعلومات المالية والمصرفية' (mawdoo3, last updated 2022). Center unchanged (Wikipedia point), not OSM-verified. BUILDINGS: empty. OpenStreetMap could not be reached from this session: overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and openstreetmap.org were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy (also from the device shell), the Chrome extension was not connected, and OSM mirrors (mapcarta) returned errors. No coordinates were guessed. Re-run the Overpass query from an unrestricted machine to fill buildings. PREVIOUS NOTES: Majors assembled from individual college pages plus the 2025/2026 direct-admission and parallel-program announcements and the finance-department fee table (the consolidated list web2.aabu.edu.jo/regDepartment/bs.jsp could not be fetched). Name variants on the site: the business college is called 'كلية الاقتصاد والعلوم الادارية' on the colleges index but 'كلية إدارة المال والأعمال' in the fee table; law degree appears as 'القانون' (fee table) and 'الحقوق' (2025/26 announcement); architecture appears as 'هندسة العمارة' in admission tables and 'هندسة العمارة والفنون الإسلامية' on the engineering page. Arts college is 'كلية الاداب' on the index, 'كلية الآداب والعلوم الإنسانية' in the fee table. Not included: 'الإمامة والوعظ والإرشاد' (Sharia; only seen in older 2017/18 pages and fee table, current status unverified), 'نظم المعلومات المحاسبية' and 'نظم المعلومات المالية والمصرفية' (only in fee table, current status unverified). IT college has a 'تكنولوجيا المعلومات' department but no matching bachelor programme was listed. Medical analysis (التحاليل الطبية) is listed under the Science college in the fee table but now has a department page under Applied Medical Sciences. Institute of Astronomy and Higher Institute of Islamic Studies appear to be graduate-only and are omitted. A 'كلية التعليم التقني' offering diplomas exists (2025 announcement) but its diploma list is only in a PDF brochure that was not readable, so no diplomas are included. Email: staff domain aabu.edu.jo confirmed (info@aabu.edu.jo, Outlook OWA link); student email domain/subdomain not verified. Coordinates from Wikipedia (32°21′40″N 36°13′08″E), not OSM. Colours per Wikipedia are green and white; no hex verified. English names are translations, not official.",
